WEBVTT

35:33.741 --> 35:36.703
- and need the practice.
- (SPEAKS DOTHRAKI)

35:36.828 --> 35:38.996
(SLAVE WHIMPERING)
(WHIP CRACKING)

35:39.914 --> 35:41.749
Tell them all to stop.

35:41.874 --> 35:45.002
You want the entire horde to stop?
For how long?

35:46.587 --> 35:48.881
Until I command them otherwise.

35:49.507 --> 35:51.759
You're learning to talk like a queen.

35:51.884 --> 35:53.803
Not a queen.

35:53.928 --> 35:55.763
A khaleesi.
